- One centred chest (180 wide, compact 120), 220 hit area (ResultChestTap, one-shot claim guard + batch reused), breathing
  glow, idle hop, flashing 点宝箱领取 hint; rays (300) only once open; floor shadow. Next/Home before opening claim first.
- Open state: lid open, InnerGlow on, rewards rise from the chest mouth (420 ms backOut, 90 ms stagger) then bob ±3 on a
  68 RewardBadge (existing icons), unlock hint under the chest. Panel sized for the open state in both states.
- Bottom 下一关/回小岛: home 3D plates, 141×56 (+6 base) on 390, gap 16, 46 from the screen edge; compact 52 high.
- ResultChest3D: CHEST_LOOK (albedoScale 1.12/1.08/1.0, roughness 0.55; Key 3.2, Fill as before, new RimLight, InnerGlow
  1.4/r2.2 only once open), square RenderTexture frame (no squash). 2D fallback popup/chest_closed replaced and
  popup/chest_open added (UI设计部 crops, 380 wide, 128-colour PNG).
- Summary reads 用了 N 步 · 剩余 M 步. Tests: result-screen-style rewritten for v2; safe_area/viewports/board_runtime/
  reward_background_return/user_priority_defects target ResultChestTap.
